        {
          "heading": "Key rules",
          "list": [
            "Comparative: short adjectives -er + than. Long adjectives more + adjective + than.",
            "Equality: as + adjective + as. Inequality: not as + adjective + as.",
            "Both + plural. Either + singular. Neither + singular.",
            "Prefer A to B. Would rather + verb + than + verb.",
            "Question tags: positive sentence → negative tag. Negative sentence → positive tag."
          ]
        },
        {
          "heading": "Common mistakes",
          "list": [
            "Do not say 'more better'. Say 'better'.",
            "Do not confuse 'both', 'either' and 'neither'.",
            "Question tags use the same auxiliary as the sentence."
          ]
        },
        {
          "heading": "Useful phrases",
          "list": [
            "... is better than ...",
            "... is as good as ...",
            "I prefer... to...",
